e:"petstore" http:{GET:"/user/logout"} selection:"$") """Get user by user name""" getUserByName("""The name that needs to be fetched. Use user1 for testing.""" username:String!):User @connect(source:"petstore" http:{GET:"/user/{$args.username}"} selection:"id\\nusername\\nfirstName\\nlastName\\nemail\\npassword\\nphone\\nuserStatus")} """Pet object that needs to be added to the store"""
